# 59_order_by_alias
# The same ordering, named through the projection's alias. Two things had to be true for
# this to work: the aggregate's output column now carries the alias the query wrote (it was
# called `sum` whatever the query said, so a client was sent a column name nobody asked
# for), and `order by` resolves against the output schema before the input one.
1 20 x1
3 30 x1
